      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Mayapiran\nThayaar: Porkodi Nachiyar\nVimanam: Purushothama Vimanam\nPushkarani: Pragna Saras\n\nTravel: This kshethram is located 5 km from Chengannur in Kerala.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nNam Azhwar 10 Pasurams",
